| Start the anyvm agent.  Installed by riscos-builder.
|
| TaskWindow, not a plain Run: the agent serves for as long as the machine is
| up, and single-tasking Python would freeze the desktop for that whole time.
|
| Every line is X-prefixed.  An error raised from a boot script stops the boot
| on a dialog that waits for a keypress, and the BCM2835 ROM has no USB
| keyboard driver, so that wait would never end.
X Obey $.Programming.Python.!Python27.!Boot
X TaskWindow "/<Python27$Dir>.python27 $.AnyVM.anyvmd/py" -wimpslot 6200k -name anyvmd -quit
